{{! How routes and climbs are drawn, as JSON (the page reads it).  Routes are thin red threads, each moved a little
    to the side of its direction of travel by an amount of its own (spread_m, in metres), so that routes over the same
    road look like one line from far and like several threads from close.  Climbs are thick transparent grey lines
    beside the road, marking sections of it: gap_px from the threads and lane_px between lanes, in pixels (so they stay
    clear of the road at any zoom); climbs on the same stretch of road go in different lanes, alternately on each side.
    smooth_rounds is the corner cutting: 0 none, 1 or 2 smooth.  Other Leaflet line options (dashArray, lineCap ...)
    can be added by changing the page template.  The heat is the squares of how often each place was visited: coloured from
    `low` (a place visited once) to `high` (the busiest), more opaque as it is busier, and each size of square (`level`: 0
    is about 100 m, 3 about 870 m, 6 about 7 km) is used from the zoom `min_zoom` (the finest that is allowed, else the
    coarsest).  Efforts (the part of a ride between the start and finish of an effort) are a thick line with a dot at each end, and
    gates (the lines across a climb that a ride has to cross) are short lines, in the colour of the end they belong to.  A colour can be a tag for one of the terminal's colours (red, green,
    blue, yellow, grey, as in the routes line below) or any #rrggbb. }}
{
  "routes": { "color": "{{{red}}}", "weight": 1, "opacity": 0.85, "spread_m": 4 },
  "climbs": { "color": "#868e96", "weight": 8, "opacity": 0.35, "gap_px": 14, "lane_px": 11 },
  "efforts": { "color": "{{{blue}}}", "weight": 5, "opacity": 0.85, "start": "{{{green}}}", "finish": "{{{red}}}", "radius": 6 },
  "gates": { "start": "{{{green}}}", "finish": "{{{red}}}", "weight": 4, "opacity": 1 },
  "heat": {
    "low": "#ffd43b", "high": "{{{red}}}", "opacity_low": 0.25, "opacity_high": 0.8,
    "levels": [ { "level": 0, "min_zoom": 14 }, { "level": 3, "min_zoom": 11 }, { "level": 6, "min_zoom": 0 } ]
  },
  "smooth_rounds": 2
}
